 <main class="main"><aside class="sidebar left"><section class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">The descent</div><div class="floor-meta"><div><div class="floor-number" id="floorNo">01</div><div class="floor-name" id="floorName">Mosslight Warrens</div></div><div style="font-size:23px">⌁</div></div><div class="progress-wrap"><div class="progress" id="floorProgress"></div></div><div class="team-status"><span>THREAT LEVEL</span><span id="threat">LOW</span></div></section><section class="panel" style="flex:1"><div class="mini-title"><div class="eyebrow">Delvers</div><span id="partyCount">3 / 3</span></div><div class="party" id="partyList"></div><div class="team-status"><span>SHARED SOULS</span><span id="soulCount">♥ ♥ ♥</span></div></section></aside>
 <section class="center"><div class="arena"><canvas id="game" aria-label="Dungeon gameplay"></canvas><div class="shade"></div><div class="arena-top"><div class="chip">FLOOR <b id="chipFloor">01</b> <span style="color:#777">·</span> <span id="roomLabel">SCOUTING</span></div><div class="chip">☠ <b id="enemyCount">0</b> <span style="color:#777">REMAIN</span></div></div><div class="arena-bottom"><div class="hint"><strong>WASD</strong> move · <strong>SPACE</strong> strike · <strong>Q</strong> skill</div><div class="event" id="eventText">The dark is listening…</div></div><div class="mobile-controls"><button id="mobileAttack">⚔</button><button id="mobileSkill">✧</button></div><div class="veil show" id="classVeil"><div class="modal"><div class="eyebrow">A party of three · local co-op</div><h1>Choose your delvers</h1><p>Pick a class for each player. Every run begins with a fresh dungeon, new threats, and three randomized rewards after each cleared floor. Two companions can be AI-controlled if you're adventuring solo.</p><div class="slot-row" id="slotLabel">PLAYER 1 — CHOOSE A CLASS</div><div class="class-grid" id="classGrid"></div><div class="action-row"><span class="small-note" id="pickNote">Choose a different class for each delver.</span><button class="gold-btn" id="startBtn" disabled>BEGIN DESCENT →</button></div></div></div><div class="veil" id="rewardVeil"><div class="modal"><div class="eyebrow">Floor secured · the delve continues</div><h1>Claim your spoils</h1><p id="rewardSub">Choose one reward for the whole party. Your choice shapes this run.</p><div class="reward-grid" id="rewardGrid"></div><div class="notice">THREE OFFERINGS · ONE CHOICE · NO TWO RUNS ALIKE</div></div></div><div class="veil" id="overVeil"><div class="modal" style="text-align:center;max-width:470px"><div class="eyebrow">The dungeon claims another tale</div><h1 id="overTitle">Party fallen</h1><p id="overText">The dark runs deep. Gather your friends and try another path.</p><div class="action-row" style="justify-content:center"><button class="gold-btn" id="retryBtn">GATHER THE PARTY ↻</button></div></div></div></div><div class="below"><div class="panel objective"><div class="objective-icon">◈</div><div><div class="objective-title" id="objectiveTitle">Clear the chamber</div><div class="objective-desc" id="objectiveDesc">Defeat every creature to find the exit.</div></div><div class="objective-count" id="objectiveCount">0 / 0</div></div><div class="panel ability"><div class="ability-key">Q</div><div><div class="ability-name" id="skillName">Party skill</div><div class="ability-note">Leader's class ability</div></div><div class="ability-cd" id="skillCd">READY</div></div></div></section>
 <aside class="sidebar right"><section class="panel"><div class="mini-title"><div class="eyebrow">Run ledger</div><span>THIS DESCENT</span></div><div class="stat-line"><span>Floors cleared</span><strong id="statFloors">0</strong></div><div class="stat-line"><span>Foes defeated</span><strong id="statKills">0</strong></div><div class="stat-line"><span>Party power</span><strong id="statPower">1.0×</strong></div><div class="stat-line"><span>Run time</span><strong id="statTime">00:00</strong></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="mini-title"><div class="eyebrow">Party relics</div><span id="relicCount">0 FOUND</span></div><div class="item-list" id="itemList"><span style="color:#777;font-size:10px">No relics yet. Earn your first after floor one.</span></div></section><section class="panel" style="flex:1"><div class="mini-title"><div class="eyebrow">Delver's journal</div><span>RECENT</span></div><div class="log" id="journal"></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Three ways to play</div><div style="font-size:10px;color:#aaa69e;line-height:1.6;margin-top:8px"><b style="color:#e2ddd2">Local co-op:</b> P1 WASD · Space · Q<br>P2 arrows · Enter · Shift<br>P3 IJKL · O · U<br><span style="color:#888">Toggle companion AI in class select.</span></div><button id="aiToggle" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#ffffff08;border:1px solid #ffffff18;font-size:10px">COMPANION AI: ON</button></section></aside></main><footer class="footer"><span>AN ENDLESS DESCENT · THREE DELVERS · ONE SHARED FATE</span><span>BUILT FOR THE BRAVE & THE RECKLESS</span></footer></div>
 <script>
+const canvas=document.getElementById('game'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');
+const classes=[
+ {name:'Vanguard',emoji:'🛡️',color:'#e4b46c',desc:'Frontline bruiser · heavy strikes',hp:130,damage:23,speed:2.55,skill:'Aegis Slam',kind:'slam'},
+ {name:'Arcanist',emoji:'🔮',color:'#b898ed',desc:'Arcane artillery · piercing bolts',hp:82,damage:18,speed:2.7,skill:'Starfall',kind:'nova'},
+ {name:'Ranger',emoji:'🏹',color:'#a6ce95',desc:'Deadeye · long-range arrows',hp:92,damage:16,speed:3.05,skill:'Volley',kind:'volley'},
+ {name:'Warden',emoji:'🌿',color:'#83cba1',desc:'Green magic · party healing',hp:112,damage:14,speed:2.65,skill:'Verdant Bloom',kind:'heal'},
+ {name:'Duelist',emoji:'🗡️',color:'#e88378',desc:'Swift blades · rapid flurries',hp:96,damage:13,speed:3.4,skill:'Whirlwind',kind:'spin'},
